sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Browser or curl
    participant M as Request-ID middleware
    participant R as Route and services
    participant L as Log output (JSON)
    B->>M: GET /api/v1/companies (maybe with X-Request-ID)
    Note over M: Keep a plain caller id, otherwise make a new one
    M->>R: handle the request
    R->>L: any log line, with request_id added automatically
    R-->>M: response
    M->>L: one summary line: status, duration_ms, request_id
    M-->>B: response with the X-Request-ID header
